Perfect! I found the answer. Looking at the proto file at `/bench/repo/proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto`, specifically lines 21-27, the CreateMemo RPC definition shows:

```21:27:proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
  option (google.api.method_signature) = "memo";
}
```

The `google.api.http` option specifies the HTTP mapping for the REST gateway.

q01. POST /api/v1/memos
